The WebP/GIF validators, bounded process pool, native GIF encoder and their
regression tests were extracted from codemao-pickcat/codemao-shequ-backend.
This standalone package replaces application-specific error types and paths.

native/vendor contains cgif v0.5.3 by Daniel Pape, distributed under the MIT
license. See native/vendor/LICENSE. The retained vendor changes check allocation
failure and initialize pow2LCT; they do not change the encoding algorithm.
